OL,3,GNEWSATech firm invests over #15m into
OL,4,AAI jobs
OL,5,
OL,6,FNewry based tech firm First Derivative
OL,7,Fhas announced a #15.3m investment in
OL,8,Fresearch and development for people
OL,9,Fworking at the cutting edge of
OL,10,FArtificial Intelligence (AI).
OL,12,FFounded by the late Newry businessman
OL,13,FBrian Conlon in 1996, but now owned by
OL,14,FEPAM, First Derivative is a global
OL,15,Fconsulting firm that provides a range
OL,16,Fof solutions for the financial services
OL,17,Findustry.
OL,19,FAlthough headquartered in Newry, the
OL,20,Fcompany has clients around the world
OL,21,Fand works with around 80 banks.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
